-- Alonecraft 4.61 -- Molten Core: tooltips for the Shadow Bolt redesign.
--
--
-- 1. THE MOLTEN CORE BUFF (47383 / 71162 / 71165) NOW CLAIMS A 100% CHANCE
--
--   These three auras are the "empowers your next Incinerate or Soul Fire"
--   buff the talent triggers, and each restates the whole talent through
--   `$47245h%` -- the *h* variable resolves to the referenced spell's
--   ProcChance straight out of the client's Spell.dbc.
--
--   woa_2026_08_02_03.sql raised the talent's ProcChance from 4/8/12 to 100 so
--   that Effect2 (the Shadow Bolt DoT) could fire on every cast, and moved the
--   original per-rank roll into spell_warl_molten_core::CheckOriginalProc
--   (WarlockDemonology.cpp:318).  The server behaves exactly as before, but the
--   client has no idea the roll moved, so the buff reads "you have a 100%
--   chance to gain the Molten Core effect".
--
--   Fixed by writing 4/8/12 literally.  A variable is only safe when the number
--   is still the one in the DBC, and here it deliberately is not.
--
--   The same descriptions also gain the Molten Fury line, so the buff restates
--   the current talent rather than the pre-redesign one.  The buff-bar string
--   (SpellToolTip0) is untouched -- it describes the Incinerate/Soul Fire
--   empowerment itself, which did not change.
--
--   None of these three had an alonecraft_spell_dbc row yet, so they are full
--   INSERTs off the Blizzard rows rather than UPDATEs.
--
--
-- 2. MOLTEN FURY (200420) DOES NOT SAY WHERE IT CAME FROM, AND WEARS
--    CORRUPTION'S ICON
--
--   woa_2026_08_04_05.sql replaced the broken "$s1 Shadow damage" (base points
--   are 0 -- the per-tick amount is computed from the Shadow Bolt hit and
--   passed via CastCustomSpell) with plain text, but the plain text says only
--   "Suffering additional Shadow damage every 3 sec", which is true of half a
--   dozen warlock effects.  Named the source instead.
--
--   SpellIconID was inherited from the spell it was cloned from and points at
--   Corruption (313), so the debuff was indistinguishable from Corruption on
--   the target frame.  Moved to 3175 -- the Molten Core talent's own icon.



